I want to use yaml-cpp library to parse some configuration file, but when I link yaml-cpp and libtorch together, I got undefined reference to YAML::LoadFile().
File main.cpp:
#include "yaml-cpp/yaml.h"

int main()
{
    std::string filename = "config.yaml"
    auto node = YAML::LoadFile(filename);
}

